<title>USA: FM Properties sale pact for Circle C ends.</title>
<headline>FM Properties sale pact for Circle C ends.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS, La. 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>FM Properties Inc said Thursday that its agreement to sell the assets of its Circle C Land Corp unit has expired.</p>
<p>FM said an investor group paid a $1 million nonrefundable cash deposit in escrow under the pact, which said the group would have to close the deal by January 8 or extend the deadline with an additional deposit of $2 million.</p>
<p>FM said it will proceed to develop and market the Circle C property, which is about 1,000 acres of commercial and multi-family property near Austin, Texas.</p>
</text>
